          %h2#references References
          %h3#general General
          %p See also
          %ul
            %li
              Wikipedia,
              %em
                %a{:href => "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Near-horizon_metric"} Near-horizon metric
          %h3#for_extremal_black_holes For extremal black holes
          %p
            That the near horizon geometry of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/extremal+black+hole"} extremal
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Reissner-Nordstr%C3%B6m+black+hole"} Reissner-Nordström black hole
            in
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi 𝒩
                  %mo =
                  %mn 2
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{N}=2
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/4d+supergravity"} 4d supergravity
            is
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi AdS
                    %mn 2
                  %mo ×
                  %msup
                    %mi S
                    %mn 2
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} AdS_2 \times S^2
            was observed in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gary+Gibbons"}> Gary Gibbons
              , in F. del Aguila,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/J.+de+Azcarraga"} J. de Azcarraga
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Luis+Ibanez"} Luis Ibanez
              (eds.)
              %em Supersymmetry, Supergravity and Related Topics
          %p Review:
          %ul
            %li
              Hari K. Kunduri, James Lucietti,
              %em Classification of Near-Horizon Geometries of Extremal Black Holes
              (
              %a{:href => "http://relativity.livingreviews.org/Articles/lrr-2013-8/title.html"}> web
              )
          %p
            Description of the near-horizon geometry of near-extremal black holes by
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jackiw-Teitelboim+gravity"} Jackiw-Teitelboim gravity
          %ul
            %li#NSST18
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Pranjal+Nayak"}> Pranjal Nayak
                , Ashish Shukla, Ronak M Soni,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sandip+Trivedi"} Sandip Trivedi
                = succeed "," do
                  %em On the Dynamics of Near-Extremal Black Holes
                %strong 2018
                48 (2018) &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/JHEP09(2018)048"}> doi:10.1007/JHEP09(2018)048
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1802.09547"} arXiv:1802.09547
            %li#MTV18
              %p
                Upamanyu Moitra,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sandip+Trivedi"} Sandip Trivedi
                %em Near-Extremal Near-Horizons
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1808.08239"}> arXiv:1808.08239
                )
          %h3#for_black_branes For black branes
          %p
            That the near horizon geometry of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/black+branes"} black branes
            in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/11-dimensional+supergravity"} 11-dimensional supergravity
            is (conformal to)
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/anti+de+Sitter+spacetime"} anti de Sitter spacetime
            times some
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/compact+space"} compact space
            is apparently due to
          %ul
            %li#GibbonsTownsend93
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gary+Gibbons"}> Gary Gibbons
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Paul+Townsend"} Paul Townsend
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Vacuum interpolation in supergravity via super p-branes
                %strong 71
                (1993) 3754-3757 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9307049"}> arXiv:hep-th/9307049
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.71.3754"} doi:10.1103/PhysRevLett.71.3754
            %li#DuffGibbonsTownsend94
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mike+Duff"}> Mike Duff
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gary+Gibbons"} Gary Gibbons
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Paul+Townsend"} Paul Townsend
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Macroscopic superstrings as interpolating solitons
                %strong 332
                (1994) 32 [
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0370-2693(94)91260-2"}> doi:10.1016/0370-2693(94)91260-2
                ,
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9405124"} arXiv:hep-th/9405124
            %li#GibbonsHorowitzTownend95
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gary+Gibbons"}> Gary Gibbons
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gary+Horowitz"} Gary Horowitz
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Paul+Townsend"} Paul Townsend
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Higher-dimensional resolution of dilatonic black hole singularities
                %strong 12
                (1995) 297 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9410073"}> arXiv:hep-th/9410073
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gary+Gibbons"}> Gary Gibbons
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    Antigravitating black hole solitons with scalar hair in
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mi N
                          %mo =
                          %mn 4
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} N=4
                    supergravity
                %strong 207
                2 (1982) 337-349 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0550-3213(82)90170-5"}> doi:10.1016/0550-3213(82)90170-5
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Renata+Kallosh"}> Renata Kallosh
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Amanda+Peet"} Amanda Peet
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Dilaton black holes near the horizon
                = succeed "," do
                  %strong 46
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevD.46.R5223"} doi:10.1103/PhysRevD.46.R5223
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sergio+Ferrara"}> Sergio Ferrara
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gary+Gibbons"} Gary Gibbons
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Renata+Kallosh"} Renata Kallosh
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Black Holes and Critical Points in Moduli Space
                %strong 500
                (1997) 75-93 [
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/S0550-3213(97)00324-6"} doi:10.1016/S0550-3213(97)00324-6
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9702103"} arXiv:hep-th/9702103
          %p
            The observation that the resulting
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/isometry+group"} isometry group
            is the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/bosonic+body"} bosonic body
            of an
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/orthosymplectic+super+group"} orthosymplectic super group
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Piet+Claus"}> Piet Claus
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Renata+Kallosh"} Renata Kallosh
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Paul+Townsend"} Paul Townsend
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Antoine+Van+Proeyen"} Antoine Van Proeyen
              = succeed "," do
                %em Conformal Theory of M2, D3, M5 and D1+D5 Branes
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9801206"} arXiv:hep-th/9801206
          %p A decent account is in:
          %ul
            %li#AFFHS98
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bobby+Acharya"}> Bobby Acharya
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jose+Figueroa-O%27Farrill"} Jose Figueroa-O'Farrill
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Chris+Hull"} Chris Hull
              = succeed "," do
                %em Branes at conical singularities and holography
              %strong 2
              (1999) 1249-1286 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9808014"}> arXiv:hep-th/9808014
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://inspirehep.net/literature/474212"} spire:474212
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://dx.doi.org/10.4310/ATMP.1998.v2.n6.a2"} doi:10.4310/ATMP.1998.v2.n6.a2
          %p reviewed in
          %ul
            %li#FigOFar98
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jose+Figueroa-O%27Farrill"}> Jose Figueroa-O'Farrill
              ,
