              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2003.09304"}> arXiv:2003.09304
              )
          %p
            Further discussion for
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M2-branes"} M2-branes
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                Harvendra Singh,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    M2-branes on a resolved
